12. Law Number 12 of 2005 concerning the Ratification of the International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2005 Number 119, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4558);
13. Law Number 21 of 2007 concerning the Eradication of the Criminal Act of Trafficking in Persons (PTPPO) (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2007 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4720);
